# Dependencies — reinstalled inside the image
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts — regenerated by the multi-stage build
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo

# Local env & secrets — NEVER bake into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Tooling & VCS noise
.git
.github
.claude
**/coverage
**/*.log
.DS_Store
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Docs not needed at runtime
docs
README.md
